{"sha": "854fe3c358e0f589dd40913e2ef621b6942e3839e6d69100ba8c32c0d6eccea6", "body": ["\\begin{proposition}[1s 电子的平均半径]\\label{prop:b2:atomic-orbitals:mean-radius}", "1s 电子到原子核的平均距离为 $\\langle r\\rangle = 3a_0/(2Z)$，", "大于其最概然半径。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "取 $Z = 1$，则 $\\langle r\\rangle = \\int_0^\\infty r\\,P(r)\\,dr = 4\\int_0^\\infty r^3\\mathrm e^{-2r}", "\\,dr = 4 \\times 3!/2^4 = 3/2$。分布在 $r$ 很大时有一条长尾，", "这使平均值超过极大值所在的位置。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[节点]\\label{def:b2:atomic-orbitals:node}", "原子轨道的\\emph{节面}\\index{节面}是这样一个曲面，", "其上波函数为零且改变符号。它是\\emph{径向节点}\\index{径向节点}", "（球面），当径向部分为零时；一个\\emph{角向", "节面}\\index{角向节面}（过原子核的平面或锥面）", "在角向部分为零时出现。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[节点计数]\\label{prop:b2:atomic-orbitals:nodes}", "轨道 $(n, l)$ 有 $n - l - 1$ 个径向节点和 $l$ 个角向节面，总计", "$n - 1$ 个。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对\\cref{thm:b2:atomic-orbitals:hydrogen}中的函数：$R_{2s}$ 在", "$\\rho = 2$ 处为零，$R_{3s}$ 在 $2\\rho^2 - 18\\rho + 27$ 的两根（$\\rho = 1.90$ 与 $7.10$）处为零，", "$R_{3p}$ 在 $\\rho = 6$ 处为零；$R_{1s}$、$R_{2p}$、$R_{3d}$ 均不为零。角向部分", "对 p 轨道在一个平面上为零（即 $z = 0$，对应 $p_z$），对 d 轨道则在两个", "平面上为零，或对 $d_{z^2}$ 在一个锥面上为零。一般情形在本阶段不加证明地承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.55\\linewidth, height=6cm, xmin=0, xmax=24, ymin=0, ymax=0.58,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={$r/a_0$}, ylabel={$P(r)$},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}, title={\\small 径向分布，$Z = 1$}]", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=r, y=s1] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-atomic-orbitals-a.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=r, y=s2] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-atomic-orbitals-a.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, thick, dashed] table[x=r, y=p2] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-atomic-orbitals-a.dat};", "\\addplot[omProp, thick] table[x=r, y=s3] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-atomic-orbitals-a.dat};", "\\addplot[omProp, thick, dashed] table[x=r, y=p3] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-atomic-orbitals-a.dat};", "\\addplot[omProp, thick, dotted] table[x=r, y=d3] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-atomic-orbitals-a.dat};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm, anchor=west] at (axis cs:1.4,0.53) {1s};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, anchor=south] at (axis cs:4.0,0.215) {2p};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:6.4,0.17) {2s};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, omProp, anchor=south] at (axis cs:10.5,0.12) {3d};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, omProp, anchor=west] at (axis cs:17,0.085) {3s, 3p};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\hfill", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.42\\linewidth, height=6cm, xmin=0, xmax=20, ymin=-0.12, ymax=0.75,", "  axis x line=middle, axis y line=left, xlabel={$r/a_0$}, ylabel={$R$},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}, title={\\small 径向部分}]", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=r, y=R2s] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-atomic-orbitals-b.dat};", "\\addplot[omProp, thick] table[x=r, y=R3s] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-atomic-orbitals-b.dat};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, anchor=west] at (axis cs:0.4,0.62) {$R_{2s}$};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, omProp, anchor=west] at (axis cs:0.6,0.30) {$R_{3s}$};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:3,0.15) {节点};", "\\draw[thin, ->] (axis cs:3,0.15) -- (axis cs:2.05,0.01);", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左：氢原子各轨道的径向分布 $P(r) = r^2R^2$，", "直至 $n = 3$；$n$ 越大，电子离核越远，s 轨道", "有较小的内侧极大值（穿透效应）。右：$R_{2s}$ 与 $R_{3s}$ 在其", "径向节点处变号（$r = 2a_0$；$1.90a_0$ 与 $7.10a_0$）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[scale only axis, width=0.32\\linewidth, height=0.32\\linewidth,", "  xmin=-6, xmax=6, ymin=-6, ymax=6, axis lines=none, title={\\small 1s}]", "\\addplot[only marks, mark=*, mark size=0.25pt, omDef] table[x=x, y=y] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-atomic-orbitals-c-1s.dat};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\hspace{0.12\\linewidth}%", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[scale only axis, width=0.32\\linewidth, height=0.32\\linewidth,", "  xmin=-14, xmax=14, ymin=-14, ymax=14, axis lines=none, title={\\small 2s}]", "\\addplot[only marks, mark=*, mark size=0.25pt, omDef] table[x=x, y=y] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-atomic-orbitals-c-2s.dat};", "\\draw[densely dashed, omThm] (axis cs:0,0) circle[radius=2];", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 氢原子 1s 与 2s 轨道在过原子核的一个平面内的点密度图：", "点的密度遵循 $|\\psi|^2$（确定性", "抽样）。2s 电子云中有一个空环，即位于 $2a_0$ 处的径向节点（虚线）；", "图框宽度分别为 12 与 28 $a_0$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{角向部分}", "", "角向部分决定形状。s 轨道呈球形；p 轨道沿其轴有两个", "符号相反的瓣，由一个节面隔开；d 轨道有", "四个符号交替的瓣（对于 $d_{z^2}$，为两个瓣和一个环）。瓣的", "符号本身没有物理意义——$\\psi$ 与 $-\\psi$ 描述同一", "状态——但两个轨道的相对符号，在下一章中", "决定它们能否成键。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\pic at (0,0) {oms={1}};", "  \\node[below] at (0,-0.75) {s};", "  \\pic at (2.0,0) {omp={1}{0}};", "  \\draw[->, black!55, thin] (1.0,0) -- (3.0,0) node[right, font=\\tiny] {$x$};", "  \\node[below] at (2.0,-0.75) {$\\mathrm p_x$};", "  \\pic at (4.2,0) {omp={1}{90}};", "  \\draw[->, black!55, thin] (4.2,-0.95) -- (4.2,0.95) node[above, font=\\tiny] {$z$};", "  \\node[below] at (4.75,-0.75) {$\\mathrm p_z$};", "  \\pic at (6.6,0) {omdxy}; \\node[below] at (6.6,-1.0) {$\\mathrm d_{xy}$};", "  \\pic at (9.0,0) {omdx2y2}; \\node[below] at (9.0,-1.0) {$\\mathrm d_{x^2-y^2}$};", "  \\pic at (11.4,0) {omdz2}; \\node[below] at (11.4,-1.0) {$\\mathrm d_{z^2}$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}